sequenceDiagram
  participant Stub as Stub resolver
  participant Rec as Recursive resolver
  participant Root as Root DNS
  participant TLD as TLD DNS
  participant Auth as Authoritative DNS
  Stub->>Rec: Query www.example.com A
  Note over Rec: Check cache
  Rec->>Root: Resolve/referral
  Root-->>Rec: Referral to TLD
  Rec->>TLD: Resolve/referral
  TLD-->>Rec: Referral to authoritative NS
  Rec->>Auth: Query A record
  Auth-->>Rec: Answer + TTL
  Rec-->>Stub: Cached answer
